  "qualitative": {
    "at1x128px": "All four directions retain readable recoil, bracing, and return-to-guard sequence at native sprite scale. Front views show upper-body/head recoil into a braced crouch, followed by rise and reset. Rear views show shoulder/torso recoil with raised arms, then settle and reset.",
    "at075x64px": "The same phase order remains clear at tactical scale; impact-to-brace is easier to parse than frame details.",
    "at05x64px": "Slow playback separates the 95ms recoil, 115ms brace, and recovery phases; it is diagnostic and not a gameplay-speed claim.",
    "zoom512px": "Inspection-only view; it reveals pixel clusters but is not used as evidence of in-game readability.",
